    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inviting",
     "texto": [
      "**Ayo ikut lomba** means \"Come on, join the contest!\". **Mari kita mendaftar** invites us to do something together. Unlike English verbs, which change with the person, these Indonesian forms don't change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Activity notices",
     "texto": [
      "On a notice, **acara mulai** shows when the event starts and **pendaftaran berakhir** when it is no longer possible to sign up."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
